# Layers

Features + data compose. Domain never import sibling domain. Processors live in `services/`. Batch job is a run. No `workflows/` folder.

```
feature / app     → data actions, domain, services
data actions      → dpo, dto, dal, domain, services
dpo               → gates, dal, dto
dto               → (pure)
dal               → services/db, drizzle
domain/<entity>   → services, utilities   (NOT data, NOT drizzle, NOT sibling domain)
services          → utilities, data/*/dal, packages/plugins
services/db       → drizzle (pool / migrate / probe only)
```

| Layer | Owns |
|-------|------|
| `features/` | Operator jobs, UI |
| `data/<Entity>/{dto,dpo,dal}` + `data/gates/` | Auth, transform, SQL |
| `domain/<entity>/` | That entity rules + `process.ts` |
| `services/ai-processor/` | All AI SDK execution |
| `services/plugins/` | Thin `executeOperation` |
| `services/batch-processor/` | Queue, claim, drain |
| `services/db/` | Connection pool only |
| `packages/plugins/{vendor}/` | Vendor handlers |

Build step = enqueue `batch_jobs` → worker → `domain/build/pipeline/run/run-step.ts`, which runs `steps/{step}/tasks/{task}`.

See `docs/private/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
